rom Side to Side, Top to Bottom"},{"type":"Paragraph","text":"Go ahead and stock up—not only does this refrigerator offer a generous 27 cu. ft. of space, but the vertical door design also offers equal access to fresh and frozen foods. Keep items of all sizes where they’re easy to see and reach."},{"type":"Headline","text":"All the Ice - All the Space"},{"type":"Paragraph","text":"Get all the ice you need without sacrificing shelf space. LG’s innovative slim, in-door design frees up freezer shelf space so you can use every inch for storage while still enjoying easy access to ice when you need it."},{"type":"Headline","text":"Redesigned with Style in Mind"},{"type":"Paragraph","text":"This new style takes your kitchen next-level with a fresh, contemporary look. Restyled bar handles are slightly contoured to comfortably fit your hand while offering quick access, and are a perfect complement to the flat panel doors."},{"type":"Headline","text":"The Look You Love (Without the Fuss)."},{"type":"Paragraph","text":"Now you can have all of the things you love about stainless, without the need for special cleaners or constant attention. LG’s PrintProof™ finish resists fingerprints and smudges for a distinctive kitchen that handles real-life in style."},{"type":"Headline","text":"ThinQ® Helps Make Life Happen"},{"type":"Paragraph","text":"The ThinQ® app offers control and convenience to help you simplify life and enjoy the comforts of home. Control your refrigerator remotely or use voice commands with Google or Alexa voice assistants. Plus, track energy and filter usage and access Smart Diagnosis, customer support, and more."},{"type":"Headline","text":"ThinQ Care™ Helps Keep Your Appliances Running Smoothly"},{"type":"Paragraph","text":"Available within the ThinQ® app, ThinQ Care™ sends proactive usage, maintenance, and diagnostic alerts to your smartphone to help keep your LG smart appliances running smoothly."},{"type":"Headline","text":"Save Money. Save Energy."},{"type":"